    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast into action with Space Ops, the ultimate survival experience in an alien world. Take control of a space marine and go toe-to-toe with relentless AI foes and extraterrestrial threats on the mysterious planet Kepler. Engage in thrilling twin-stick, top-down shooting and unlock a variety of game modes. But that's not all \u2013 the highly anticipated multiplayer mode is on its way! Get ready for hours of non-stop entertainment and save the universe, one enemy at a time.</p>",
